:: Apartment Bedroom
<<initPlayState>>\
<<pronouns "player">>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-bedroom", "Garden South Street — Apartment")>>\
You stand in the bedroom of your apartment.

<<link "Sleep in what you’re currently wearing">><<goto "Apartment Bedroom Sleep">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<link "Leave Bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:00)</span>">><<goto "Apartment Living Room">><</link>>
<<link "Leave Apartment <span class='action-time'>(0:05)</span>">><<run World.advance(5)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway">><</link>>

:: Apartment Bedroom Sleep
<<initPlayState>>\
<<pronouns "player">>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-bedroom", "Garden South Street — Apartment")>>\
How long do you want to sleep?

<<for _h to 1; _h lte 10; _h++>>\
<<capture _h>>\
<<link `"Sleep for " + _h + " hour" + (_h === 1 ? "" : "s") + " <span class='action-time'>(" + World.wakeTimeFor(_h) + ")</span>"`>><<set $sleepHours to _h>><<unset $sleepResult>><<goto "Apartment Bedroom Wake">><</link>> <<= Stats.effectMarkup("fatigue", "-")>>
<</capture>>\
<</for>>\
<<link "Just sleep <span class='action-time'>(??:??)</span>">><<set $sleepHours to getRandomIntInclusive(4, 8)>><<unset $sleepResult>><<goto "Apartment Bedroom Wake">><</link>> <<= Stats.effectMarkup("fatigue", "-")>>
<<link "Never mind">><<goto "Apartment Bedroom">><</link>>

:: Apartment Bedroom Wake
<<initPlayState>>\
<<pronouns "player">>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-bedroom", "Garden South Street — Apartment")>>\
<<if def $sleepHours>>\
<<set $sleepResult to World.sleepFor($sleepHours)>>\
<<unset $sleepHours>>\
<<elseif ndef $sleepResult>>\
<<set $sleepResult to { hours: 0, forcedWake: false }>>\
<</if>>\
You sleep for <<= $sleepResult.hours>> hour<<if $sleepResult.hours !== 1>>s<</if>> and wake at <<= World.formatTime()>>. <<= Stats.effectMarkup("fatigue", "-")>>\
<<if $sleepResult.forcedWake>>

Exhaustion pulled you under until the weekday morning arrived.<</if>>

<<link "Get up">><<unset $sleepResult>><<goto "Apartment Bedroom">><</link>>
